# Scenario 05: Havender's Resource Ordering Prevention
MODE prevention
PREVENTION ordering

# Resources with strict rank: R0 (Rank 0) < R1 (Rank 1) < R2 (Rank 2)
RESOURCE R0 1 0
RESOURCE R1 1 1
RESOURCE R2 1 2

PROCESS Alpha 1 1.0
PROCESS Beta 2 1.0

CLAIM Alpha 1 1 0
CLAIM Beta 0 1 1

# Alpha acquires R0 first (Rank 0) -> Valid
REQUEST Alpha 1 0 0

# Alpha requests R1 (Rank 1 > 0) -> Valid
REQUEST Alpha 0 1 0

PRINT_STATE
